   "x": 1520,
   "y": 480,
   "w": 480,
   "text": "Rules kept from v46\nVendor record IDs (SUB-…) and course codes stay visible; the Super Admin no-IDs rule is not extended. Publishing is never the Vendor’s action. Saved changes to a returned experiment stay private until resubmitted. Only assigned courses can be chosen; MEL ZG512 records are read-only. Delivery shows current stand-ins only: web links, package labels and references, documents by name.",
