   "text": "Resubmitted revisions stay “Submitted”\nIn the app a resubmitted revision goes straight back to the Academic Reviewer (the accepted local route). The Vendor is not told the next stage: record, list, Overview and history say “Submitted · revision 2” until a reviewer decides, Composite Wall included. Showing the stage stays open policy (M-3).",
